    "actClause": "AN ACT in relation to requiring that COVID-19 contact tracers be\nrepresentative of the cultural and linguistic diversity of the communities in\nwhich they serve to the greatest extent possible; and providing for the repeal\nof such provisions upon the expiration thereof",
    "basePrintNo": "S8829",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S8829-2019",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [
